abstract: >-
  Code, model outputs and derived data for a study that applies four annotation
  schemes based on published theories of the creative process, with brief clarifying notes where needed, to a
  sentence-level corpus of letters in which four creators write about work in
  progress. An offline script recomputes the figures in the paper that rest only
  on the model annotators' labels.
